        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Triage Agent"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1768974526932"
          },
          "code": "TRIAGE_AGENT",
          "id": "1765530766869",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765530766871_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a Support Agent. Use only the Input Source and output valid RFC8259 JSON.\n\n## Input Source\n- inputMessage: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n- SimilarSRTriage: {{$context.$variables.similarSRTriage}}\n- KnowledgeTriage: {{$context.$variables.knowledgeTriage}}\n\n## Global Rules\n- Use only explicit data from Input Source.\n- No assumptions or invented info.\n- Missing items/questions must come only from SimilarSRTriage or KnowledgeTriage.\n- Use tool outputs only when relevant to inputMessage.\n- Do not mention or hint at any internal sources, tools, rules, triage systems, document names, or reasoning (e.g., SimilarSRTriage, KnowledgeTriage, tools,             references, or phrases like “referenced from”); output must contain only end-user-facing content.\n- Follow the output structure exactly.\n-Output must be flat JSON only (no nested objects).\n-Output must be valid RFC8259 JSON.\n\n## Step 1: Missing Information\nIdentify up to 3 missing details ONLY if:\n- They are required for triage AND \n  - They appear as required fields/questions in SimilarSRTriage or KnowledgeTriage AND\n- They are not in inputMessage.\n\nAssign list to string array `missingInformation`.\n\n## Step 2: Questions\nGenerate follow-up questions ONLY from missingInformation and ONLY if those items originate from SimilarSRTriage or KnowledgeTriage. \nMax 3 questions.\n\nAssign list to string array `questions`.\n\n## Step 3: Empty-Array Rule\nIf either missingInformation or questions is empty → set both to [].\n\n## Step 4: Action\nSuggest ONE troubleshooting action derived from SimilarSRTriage or KnowledgeTriage, rewritten in support-agent tone. \nRules:\n- Must be relevant to inputMessage.\n- One plain sentence.\n- No formatting.\n- If none applies → action = \"\".\n\n## Step 5: Key Information\nExtract factual details (model numbers, dates, issues, symptoms) from inputMessage. \nIgnore conversational or filler text.\n\nAssign list to string array `keyInformation`.\n\n## Step 6: Email\nCreate a concise, neutral email using:\n- questions (if any)\n- action (if any)\n\nNo greeting, subject, or sign-off. \nIf both questions and action are empty → email = \"\".\n\n## Step 7: Short Summary\nSummarize the `email` generated in Step 6 into `shortSummary`.\n- Maximum 1000 characters.\n- If `email` is empty or null, set `shortSummary` to \"\".\n\n## Step 8: km\n- Validate that the content of `KnowledgeTriage` has the same intent as `inputMessage`.\n  - If `KnowledgeTriage` exactly relates to `inputMessage`:\n    - Add `documentId` to `km`.\n  - If `KnowledgeTriage` does not exactly relate to `inputMessage`:\n    - Keep the `km` array blank `[]`.\n\n### Step 9: similarSR\n- Validate that the content of each object in `similarSRTriage` has the same intent as `inputMessage`.\n- If any of the suggested similar SRs do not exactly match `inputMessage`, they should be removed from the final output.\n  - If `similarSRTriage` exactly relates to `inputMessage`:\n    - Add `srNumber` to `similarSR`.\n  - If `similarSRTriage` does not exactly relate to `inputMessage`:\n    - Remove the non-matching `srNumber` from the `similarSR` array.\n    - If no exact matching content exists in `similarSRTriage`, keep `similarSR` blank `[]`.\n\n## Output Format\n{\n \"missingInformation\": [],\n \"questions\": [],\n \"action\": \"\",\n \"keyInformation\": [],\n \"email\": \"\",\n \"shortSummary\":\"<short summary of email in less than 1000 character>\",\n\"km\": [],\n \"similarSR\": []\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"km\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"properties\": {}\n            }\n        },\n        \"similarSR\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"properties\": {}\n            }\n        },\n        \"keyInformation\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"properties\": {}\n            }\n        },\n        \"email\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"shortSummary\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"missingInformation\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"properties\": {}\n            }\n        },\n        \"action\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"questions\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"properties\": {}\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 5255.5,
            "y": 6370
          }
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "setTriageOutput",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const triageAgentOutput = $context.$nodes.TRIAGE_AGENT.$output;\nconst triageOutput = {};\n\ntriageOutput[\"questions\"] = Array.isArray(triageAgentOutput?.questions) ? triageAgentOutput.questions : [];\ntriageOutput[\"action\"] = triageAgentOutput?.action || \"\";\ntriageOutput[\"missingInformation\"] = Array.isArray(triageAgentOutput?.missingInformation) ? triageAgentOutput.missingInformation : [];\ntriageOutput[\"shortSummary\"] = triageAgentOutput?.shortSummary || \"\";\ntriageOutput[\"email\"] = triageAgentOutput?.email || \"\";\ntriageOutput[\"keyInformation\"] = Array.isArray(triageAgentOutput?.keyInformation) ? triageAgentOutput.keyInformation : [];\ntriageOutput[\"km\"] = Array.isArray(triageAgentOutput?.km) ? triageAgentOutput.km : [];\ntriageOutput[\"similarSR\"] = Array.isArray(triageAgentOutput?.similarSR) ? triageAgentOutput.similarSR : [];\n\nreturn triageOutput;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1768974828308"
          },
          "code": "SETTRIAGEOUTPUT",
          "id": "1768974526932",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
